  "notes": "Highest-consequence resource in this set; emergency numbers must be re-verified before 2027-08-31. Recorded conflicts: the Title IX department web page still narrates the federal regulations effective 2020-08-14 while Regulation 3-4018, effective 2025-06-26, is the controlling public NCF source, so the regulation is used throughout; the August 2023 Faculty Handbook's 'Counseling and Wellness Center, 5805 Bay Shore Road, ext. 4254' is superseded by the current Health and Wellness Services pages. Recorded gap: no verified public page exists in this corpus for a designated school official or international student services office serving enrolled students on visa matters. The two Maxient reporting forms were verified as publicly reachable without authentication on 2026-08-31."
